      "text": "UNTRUSTED LOCAL MCP\n\nForge broker  ->  length-framed stdio  ->  supervised worker  ->  disposable VM / remote sandbox  ->  MCP server\n\nPortable common IPC: anonymous stdio. UDS, Hyper-V sockets, or Windows named pipes remain private sandbox-driver details. No unsafe host fallback.",
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "UNTRUSTED LOCAL MCP\n\nForge broker  ->  length-framed stdio  ->  supervised worker  ->  disposable VM / remote sandbox  ->  MCP server\n\nPortable common IPC: anonymous stdio. UDS, Hyper-V sockets, or Windows named pipes remain private sandbox-driver details. No unsafe host fallback.",
